    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "This weirdo's way too strong! She's beaten back so many of us already!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't get what she's saying, but she's no joke!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "I reckon she'd make a fine Great Chief!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Gavial, your friend's really strong.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She sure is a pain in the ass at times like this though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think we finally hit a lull. I'm gonna go up there and restrain her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, Reunion! You're back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you were the ones who took the Doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't get away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, you dumb... She's gonna escape again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going after her! Tomimi, you and the Doctor stay put! I'll come back and find you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "......",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, there's another fight starting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor, could you tell me what Gavial is like on the outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(Tell her about Gavial's life at Rhodes Island.);......;(Tell her about Gavial as a doctor.)",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Gavial having a good life out there, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you don't know Gavial that well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's great! ...Um, no, I was just thinking since Gavial came back with you, and she seemed to really like you, and it looks like you get along really well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's okay! Gavial's a really nice person! I think you can definitely get along with her!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's great! Even if she's a doctor, Gavial's still Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's good to know. Gavial hasn't changed. What a relief...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So if Gavial decided to leave you one day, how would you feel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It'd be sad, for sure.;......;I'd be glad she found a new path in life.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm. I cried a lot when it happened, too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "How... How could you be like that?! Gavial's such a good person! How could you care so little if she left?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "You're incredible... I couldn't do that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I always hoped Gavial would come back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, um, about Gavial...! I-I'm not gonna let you take her from me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Good luck.;(Nod.);And I won't let you take her from me!",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "So how DID that ceremony back then turn out?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Um, that one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
