    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, what? You call me a kid, and this is all you've got?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who else is gonna challenge me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She beat a lot of fighters more experienced than her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, you rule!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's wild to say, but could she be the next Great Chief?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take you on!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, what the hell are you doing here, Zumama?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weren't you busy building your machines? Every time I went looking for you, you ignored me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I decided to come and see, in the end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zumama"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "See what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "See if my fists could beat you or not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zumama"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You say that like you wanna get killed dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough talk. I'm not losing to you today, Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zumama"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you won't know until you've tried!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
